cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the MALICE dataset, please cite the following paper."
title: "MALICE: Malicious Adversarial LLM Inputs for Code Generation"
abstract: >-
  A large-scale adversarial benchmark of ~250K code-mixed and transliterated
  prompts for evaluating the robustness of Code LLM safety guardrails under
  linguistically diverse inputs.
